    <briefdescription>
<para>This is a mechanism for reporting warnings about the AST, subtrees, and IR nodes. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Possible problems with the AST which constitute concerns but not fatal errors are reported. Such information includes: <linebreak/>
-#) shared nodes, -#) nodes with default file source position imformation -#) ... </para>    </detaileddescription>
